      "title": "Introduction",
      "gist": "Flexible top-down control of hundreds of millions of neurons is too demanding for synaptic changes alone, so brain waves that shape spiking may supply it.",
      "question": "Introduction — why might brain waves be needed to explain flexible control? (an argument)"
    },
